---@field animate? RectAnimations|Bound Tween named properties to each newly resolved value without running Lua (ADR-0145). `move` eases a matched node to its new parent-relative layout position; an ancestor that shifts needs its own `move`. `exit` runs after removal. Only a node already on screen animates, unless an entry has `from`.
---@field children? Node[]|Bound Stacked in order: later children paint over earlier ones. At most 10000; a `nil` or `false` entry is an error.

